out.push("\n\n例如保留 Cart 按钮本身：\n\n```javascript\nfunction updateCartIcon(count) {\n  const button = document.querySelector(\n    '#HeaderCartButton'\n  );\n\n  const badge = button.querySelector('.cart-count');\n\n  badge.textContent = String(count);\n\n  button.setAttribute(\n    'aria-label',\n    `Shopping cart, ${count} ${count === 1 ? 'item' : 'items'}`\n  );\n}\n```\n\n这样既能够更新视觉 UI，也能够保留 DOM 节点、原有事件以及当前焦点。\n\n生产项目还需要使用翻译后的名称模板。\n\n**Section Rendering 的无障碍优化，很多时候不是增加 ARIA，而是减少不必要的 DOM 销毁。**\n\n---\n\n## 14. Header 自动化测试\n\n### 14.1 测试 Skip Link\n\n```javascript\nimport { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';\n\ntest('skip link bypasses header navigation', async ({ page }) => {\n  await page.goto('/');\n\n  await page.keyboard.press('Tab');\n\n  const skipLink = page.getByRole('link', {\n    name: 'Skip to content'\n  });\n\n  await expect(skipLink).toBeFocused();\n\n  await page.keyboard.press('Enter');\n\n  await expect(\n    page.locator('#MainContent')\n  ).toBeFocused();\n});\n```\n\n### 14.2 测试 Mega Menu\n\n```javascript\ntest('mega menu keyboard navigation', async ({ page }) => {\n  await page.goto('/');\n\n  const summary = page.locator(\n    '.mega-menu > summary'\n  ).filter({\n    hasText: 'Clothing'\n  });\n\n  await summary.focus();\n  await summary.press('Enter');\n\n  const details = summary.locator('..');\n\n  await expect(details).toHaveJSProperty(\n    'open',\n    true\n  );\n\n  await page.keyboard.press('Tab');\n\n  const childLink = details.getByRole('link', {\n    name: 'View all Clothing'\n  });\n\n  await expect(childLink).toBeFocused();\n\n  await page.keyboard.press('Escape');\n\n  await expect(details).toHaveJSProperty(\n    'open',\n    false\n  );\n\n  await expect(summary).toBeFocused();\n});\n```\n\n### 14.3 测试 Search Modal\n\n```javascript\ntest('search modal restores focus', async ({ page }) => {\n  await page.goto('/');\n\n  const trigger = page.getByRole('button', {\n    name: 'Search',\n    exact: true\n  });\n\n  await trigger.focus();\n  await trigger.press('Enter');\n\n  const dialog = page.getByRole('dialog', {\n    name: 'Search products'\n  });\n\n  await expect(dialog).toBeVisible();\n\n  const input = dialog.getByRole('combobox');\n\n  await expect(input).toBeFocused();\n\n  await page.keyboard.press('Escape');\n\n  await expect(dialog).toBeHidden();\n\n  await expect(trigger).toBeFocused();\n});\n```\n\n这些测试针对本课设计的英文页面及组件结构，并非可以无修改地用于所有 Dawn 版本的测试脚本。\n\n---\n\n## 15. Header 无障碍审计与 WCAG 对照\n\n| 常见问题 | 对应准则 |\n|---|---|\n| 无法跳过重复导航 | 2.4.1 Bypass Blocks |\n| Mega Menu 只能通过 Hover 展开 | 2.1.1 Keyboard |\n| 移动端菜单无法通过键盘退出 | 2.1.2 No Keyboard Trap |\n| 隐藏的子菜单链接仍可聚焦 | 2.4.3 Focus Order |\n| 图标按钮没有 Accessible Name | 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value |\n| Sticky Header 完全遮挡焦点 | 2.4.11 Focus Not Obscured |\n| 图标点击区域过小且不符合例外 | 2.5.8 Target Size |\n| Hover 菜单无法关闭 | 1.4.13 Content on Hover or Focus |\n| 当前导航仅通过颜色表达 | 1.4.1 Use of Color |\n| 搜索结果数量通知缺失 | 4.1.3 Status Messages |\n| 自动切换国家造成意外跳转 | 3.2.2 On Input |\n| Announcement Bar 无法暂停 | 2.2.2 Pause, Stop, Hide |\n\n具体是否违规，需要结合每项准则的适用条件进行判断。\n\n## 16. 本课知识测试\n\n");
